B.aLS=new A.an(B.cV,["How do I list a new product?","Open the marketplace management section and add product name, price (\u20b9/unit), unit, stock and pickup location."],t.w)
B.aLR=new A.an(B.cV,["How can I update stock quickly?","Edit the product and change the stock number. Buyers will see the update instantly in the catalog."],t.w)
B.aLU=new A.an(B.cV,["How are platform fees applied?","Platform fees are charged to the buyer based on their cart quantity. You receive the listed price per unit."],t.w)
B.aLY=new A.an(B.cV,["How do I handle order acceptance or rejection?","From Order Tracking, approve or reject steps. The system records time and shows clear status to the buyer."],t.w)
B.aLT=new A.an(B.cV,["Can I set pickup-only orders?","Yes. Provide a pickup address on the product. Buyers can coordinate collection after purchase."],t.w)
B.aLQ=new A.an(B.cV,["Tips to attract more buyers?","Keep prices competitive, update stock daily, add clear unit labels (e.g., kg/bundle) and maintain accurate pickup timings."],t.w)
